WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.898 --> 00:00:19.708
Everything an instructor does starts from the kiosk.

2
00:00:19.708 --> 00:00:27.122
Tap Management, in the row under the two big buttons.

3
00:00:27.122 --> 00:00:30.314
The panel is behind your instructor PIN.

4
00:00:30.314 --> 00:00:34.549
Face ID is the shortcut — the PIN is what actually opens it.

5
00:00:34.549 --> 00:00:40.216
Type your PIN.

6
00:00:40.216 --> 00:00:45.710
Then tap Unlock.

7
00:00:45.710 --> 00:00:51.436
This is the Instructor Panel: Records, Add New and Export.

8
00:00:51.436 --> 00:00:57.577
Unenrolling hides someone from check-in without deleting them.

9
00:00:57.577 --> 00:01:04.160
Find the attendee and tap Unenroll.

10
00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:09.459
The warning says exactly what will happen.

11
00:01:09.459 --> 00:01:17.346
Confirm. Their past attendance is kept either way.

12
00:01:17.346 --> 00:01:23.121
They move to the Unenrolled group, at the foot of the list.

13
00:01:23.121 --> 00:01:27.705
The tile at the top counts them too.

14
00:01:27.705 --> 00:01:37.433
Tap Re-enroll to put them back on the roster.
